{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y的音乐感受描写不如X细密，尤其缺少按小节出现的声部变化、音色层次、旋律起伏和收束细节，听觉体验相对概括。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的重点经过放大加亮，短句也容易扫读，而且音乐感受有更细的层次和时间对应；但部分感受意象较多，容易让人沉浸在零散画面里，未必抓得住人物心理发展的因果。Y虽然叙事文字较长，却把每一阶段为什么高兴、为什么害怕、为什么退缩以及前后心态如何变化交代得更完整，尤其通过前后呼应让整段关系发展成为一件连贯的事。作为第一次观看、边听边扫的普通观众，我更愿意选Y，因为理解人物和跟住故事比获得更多零散的感受细节更重要。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f4e4140a-5ff6-4c0b-a0df-5d71e5bc22ee", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T183946677395Z", "elapsed_seconds": 117.86, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T18:41:44.537801+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5f8b4a2005251f028992bc31fc49823a3b1d20483b2204d9147844c508873278", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683